<title>USA: Strategia sets public offering.</title>
<headline>Strategia sets public offering.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategia Corp said on Tuesday its board of directors had authorized the company to proceed with an underwritten public offering.</p>
<p>It is anticipated that the company will offer about 1.5 million units consisting of one share of common stock and a warrant to purchase one more share of common stock.</p>
<p>Strategia provides computer services in North America and Europe through data centers in Louisville and Paris. -- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
